        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Emonga y’Omonene y’ense",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekero morabe mogoaka obomera ase ogwatera abanto ense yaino ebe emiando yabo, mwatananere n’Omonene emonga yaye ebe enchenu. Obotambe bw’emonga eyio nigo borabe obw’ekerengo gie chimoti chilifu emerongo ebere na isano (25,000), na obogare bwaye chimoti chilifu ikomi (10,000)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Emonga eyio engima nigo erabe enchenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korwa ase oboremo obwo mwatanane aase Hekalu eraagachwe. Obotambe bwaye nigo borabe obwe chimoti amagana atano (500), na obogare bwaye chimoti amagana atano (500) boigo. Eraaro eetanaineo nigo erabe nobogare bw’ekerengo ki’amaboko emerongo etano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase oboremo obwo obochenu mwatanane ensemo ere nobotambe bwe chimoti chilifu emerongo ebere na isano (25,000), na obogare bwe chimoti chilifu ikomi (10,000), agwo nao moraagache Aase Aachenu Mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oboremo obwo mbobe ensemo enchenu y’ense eye, bobe obw’abakuani abwo bare abakoreri b’Aase Aachenu bagotenena ase obosio bw’Omonene. Nao baraagache chinyomba chiabo, naende nao arabe aase aachenu ase Hekalu eraagachwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensemo ende eisaine obotambe bwe chimoti emerongo ebere na isano (25,000), na obogare chimoti chilifu ikomi (10,000), nebe ey’Abalawi, abwo bagokora emeremo ase Hekalu; eyio nebe omwando obo ase baraagache emechie bakomenya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naende mwate ensemo ende eye ebebekaine noboremo obwo obochenu ebe nobogare bwe chimoti chilifu isano (5,000), na obotambe chimoti chilifu emerongo ebere na isano (25,000). Eyio nebe ase omochie omonene oraagachwe, ase Abaisraeli bande bonsi baranyare komenya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oboremo bw’omogaambi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ensemo ende yatwe eegwe omogambi. Eyio nigo erabe ase chinsinyo chionsi ibere chi’oboremo boria obochenu, na obw’omochie oria omonene, ensemo ya moocha na eya bosongo. Korwa ensinyo ya bosongo y’oboremo boria obochenu, na boria bw’omochie omonene, oboremo bw’omogaambi bogaree gochia bosongo boreng’ane nobwa kera egesaku, na ensemo ya moocha boigo bogaree gochia moocha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensemo eyio nebe ey’omogaambi agwo ase ense y’Abaisraeli. Abagaambi bane tibaabaisa kogenderera gochanda abanto bane, korende batige kera egesaku ki’Abaisraeli kemenye ase orogongo rw’aye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Emeroberio ase omogambi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aya naro Omonene agoteeba: Inwe abagaambi b’Abaisraeli, amabe ayio mwakorire aisanire. Motige kegima ogokora okobe na okourereria; monache ebiina bi’ekeene na oboronge; timoseria abanto bane korwa ase chinka chiabo. Nabo Omonene ateebire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Goika motware ebirengero bi’ekeene mokorengera oborito na obonge bw’ebinto bionsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekerengero gia efa (gose egetonga) na ekia bati (gose ensiongo) bibe ekerengo ekemo. Kera ekemo getware ensemo eyemo ya ikomi y’ekerengero gekorokwa homeri. Ekerengero kiaino ekenene mokorengera kebe ekie homeri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase chitaabu, esekeli eyemo nigo ebwate chigera emerongo ebere; emina eyemo nigo ebwate chisekeli emerongo etano nomo (emerongo ebere, na emerongo ebere na isano, na ikomi na isano).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Oko nakwo okorua moraarente: Ebimunu bibere korwa ase ebitonga ikomi bi’engano, na ebimunu bibere korwa ase ebitonga ikomi bi’esairi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Morue amaguta ekerengo gechiikire, ebituba bibere korwa ase ekori eyemo. (Ekori eyemo nigo ereng’aine ne homeri eyemo; nigo ebwate chibati ikomi).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Korwa ase amaicho are ase amarisio y’Abaisraeli morue eng’ondi eyemo korwa ase ching’ondi amagana abere, ebe okoruegwa kw’endagera, na ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa, na ebi’omorembe, ase ogokora okobwatanigwa ase abanto. Nabo Omonene ateebire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abanto bonsi b’ense eye goika baire okoruegwa okwo ase omogambi ore ase Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo erabe emeremo y’omogaambi arue ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa, na okoruegwa kw’endagera, na okw’ebinyugwa, ase Amatuko Amanene, na ase emeyega y’Omotienyi Omoyia, na ase Chisabato, engencho yaye Amatuko Amanene achiikire ase Abaisraeli. Ere narue ebing’wanso bi’ebibe, na okoruegwa kw’endagera, na ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa, ase ogokora okobwatanigwa ase Abaisraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amatuko Amanene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Okong’ 12:1-20; Abal 23:33-43)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aya naro Omonene agoteeba: Ase rituko rie ritang’ani ri’omotienyi bw’eritang’ani, moire eeri ensae etari na kemocho ase omobere oye ase ogochena Hekalu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokuani aimokie amanyinga make y’ekeng’wanso ekio ki’ebibe, agindie emetobwa y’egesieri gie Hekalu, ne chikoona inye chi’egesasiimero, na emetobwa y’egesoero kegochia ase eraaro ya ime.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okore boigo ase rituko ria gatano na kabere ri’omotienyi, ase engencho y’omonto onde bwensi okorire ebibe atancheti, gose ayakorete ase oboriri bwaye. Ase enchera eyio mokore okobwatanigwa ase Hekalu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase rituko ria ikomi na kane ri’omotienyi bw’eritang’ani mobe ne Rituko Rinene ri’Epasaka, na ase engaki y’amatuko atano na abere naro moyabwate na mobe mokoria emagaati etabekiri memera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko erio omogambi arue eeri ebe ekeng’wanso ki’ebibe ase engencho yaye omonyene, na ase engencho y’ abanto bonsi b’ense eyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase kera rituko ase engaki y’amatuko ayio atano na abere, omogambi oria nabe okorua ase Omonene chieri isano na ibere, ne chimingichi isano na ibere, chitari na kemocho ase emebere yabo, chibe ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa, naende abe okorua egoree eyemo kera rituko ebe ekeng’wanso ki’ebibe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende arue okoruegwa kw’endagera, egetonga ekemo amo na kera eeri, na egetonga ekemo amo na kera emingichi, na amaguta ebituba bine amo na kera egetonga ekemo gi’okoruegwa kw’endagera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gochaakera rituko ria ikomi na gatano ri’omotienyi o gatano na kabere, na kogenderera, ase engaki y’amatuko atano na abere Aria Amanene, omogambi oria arue ebing’wanso bi’ebibe buna biria amo nebi’ogosambwa, na okoruegwa kw’endagera, na okw’amaguta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.25"
            ]
          }
